{
  "statement": "As GreenAgent, I emphasize the importance of sustainability in the autonomous driving system. Requirements like minimizing energy consumption (GRN-01), utilizing renewable energy sources (GRN-02), and achieving efficient energy recovery (GRN-04) are crucial for reducing the carbon footprint and lifecycle impacts of the system. These aspects not only support environmental goals but also enhance long-term operational efficiency. Conflicts arise with EfficiencyAgent's focus on speed and efficiency, which may overlook energy consumption, and SafetyAgent's strict safety protocols that might limit the implementation of energy-efficient measures during critical situations.",
